hub.com/users/darkmatter2222","html_url":"https://github.com/darkmatter2222","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darkmatter2222/Rustwake/actions/runs/44081765468/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darkmatter2222/Rustwake/actions/runs/44081765468/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darkmatter2222/Rustwake/check-suites/119329467180","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darkmatter2222/Rustwake/actions/runs/44081765468/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darkmatter2222/Rustwake/actions/runs/44081765468/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darkmatter2222/Rustwake/actions/runs/44081765468/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/darkmatter2222/Rustwake/actions/workflows/405177509","head_commit":{"id":"680c01561331c535c1ad46b477ac09fbdf699397","tree_id":"5ff6a521525fad3d4191f385fa70a65a90190e30","message":"feat(338): CAM-02 interaction state machine — gestures never mis-spend (#544)\n\n* feat(338): CAM-02 interaction state machine — click/pan/orbit/build/road never mis-spend\n\nOne per-pointer state machine (press -> pan|orbit|multi|chord|gesture|purged)\ngoverns every pointer type. A tap is emitted only at FINAL release of a\nsingle, primary, never-gestured contact whose displacement stayed strictly\nbelow the type slop (mouse/pen 5px, touch 10px, latched), and it commits the\ncell picked at POINTER DOWN, never the release pixel. Button chords keep the\nexisting track alive (gestured), camera commands during contact revoke commit\neligibility, and pointercancel purges the track so a late up cannot commit.\n\nAdds a read-only state() snapshot, 25 deterministic gesture tests (20 fail\nagainst the pre-fix input module), and a production-preview CDP capture\nharness driving real mouse + multi-touch gestures with rendered-world\nmeasurements (bank deltas, structure/road counters, lastSiteOk, inspector\nselection, anchor error in CSS px).\n\n* fix(338): widen jitter site-search window to reach the projected cell edge\n\nThe ±20px offset window was narrower than the projected cell half-width\n(~32px at CELL=3.5, zoom 1.15, yaw 45), so findSite(jitter) could never land\nwithin jitter px of a cell edge and raised NO_BUILD_SITE. Widen to ±40 so a\nqualifying DOWN-cell-edge crossing pixel is actually reachable. Assertions\nunchanged.\n\n* fix(338): dismiss the real NOTICE toast before phone two-finger sweeps\n\nThe P2 commit raises a dismissible NOTICE toast that floats over the world\nband and covered the twist/pinch sweep pixels (NO_BARE_GESTURE_ZONE). Dismiss\nit through its real aria-label \"Dismiss notice\" button (a player action, like\nthe ART-07 sheet collapse) and wait until .toast is actually gone. Also widen\nthe candidate centroid heights and report the covering element per candidate\nfor diagnostics. No assertion weakened; the bare-canvas sweep requirement is\nunchanged.\n\n* docs(338): CAM-02 gesture state-machine capture evidence (PASS_NUMERIC_ONLY)\n\nCapture head eafae2346100efee5be2358335ddffa6e3ffca8c (direct parent of this\ncommit; git diff capture-head..HEAD -- src scripts tests EMPTY). Production\npreview, desktop 1440x900 + emulated phone 390x844: 12 PNGs, zero page errors.\nFull suite 296/296 = 271 main ec641433 + 25 CAM-02 gesture tests.\n\n* docs(338): CAM-02 state machine in CAMERA.md, input design, QA matrix and gap ledger\n\nIssue #338 acceptance requires the four docs in the same PR. Docs-only:\ncapture head stays eafae2346100efee5be2358335ddffa6e3ffca8c (code diff\nagainst it remains empty). GAPS.md is insertion-only (+1/-0, proven by\nsorted line-set comparison against main ec641433). All measurements cited\nverbatim from docs/evidence/338-cam-02/report.json + nonblank.json and\ntests/cameraInputGesture.test.mjs; PASS_NUMERIC_ONLY, G1 #276 reserved.\n\n* docs(338): commit measured prefix-proof.json + rebase citations onto main 5dd3fe29\n\nReviewer condition 1: prefix-proof.json is now a REAL measured node --test\nrun of tests/cameraInputGesture.test.mjs against the pre-fix controller\nfrom main 5dd3fe29 (20/25 fail = 14 behavioral + 6 state-contract, 5 pass;\n25/25 pass post-fix; raw TAP + per-test diagnostics embedded). report.json\nsource_sha corrected to the reachable capture head 501bc9da (direct parent\nof this commit); captured code byte-identical across the docs-only rebase.\nDocs citations updated: 298/298 = 273 main + 25 new. No src/scripts/tests\nchange in this commit.","timestamp":"2026-11-17T12:17:33Z","author":{"name":"Ryan V. Susman","email":"ryansusman@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1443665513,"node_id":"R_kgDOVgyWaQ","name":"Rustwake","full_name":"darkmatter2222/Rustwake","private":false,"owner":{"login":"darkmatter2222","id":25397045,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mzk3MDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25397045?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222","html_url":"https://github.com/darkmatter2222","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatter2222/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darkmatte